<h2>Account Appeal Decision</h2>
<p>Hello {{name}},</p>
<p>The RevoShelf moderation team has reviewed your account reconsideration request.</p>

{{#if approved}}
<div style="background-color: #f0fdf4; border-left: 4px solid #22c55e; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0; font-size: 15px; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; color: #166534;">
  <strong>Decision: Approved</strong>
  <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0; line-height: 1.5;">Your appeal has been accepted and your account has been fully restored! You can now log back in and continue listing or browsing books.</p>
</div>
<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
  <tr>
    <td align="center">
      <a href="{{frontendUrl}}/login" class="button" style="color: #ffffff; background-color: #22c55e;">Log In to RevoShelf</a>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
{{else}}
<div style="background-color: #fef2f2; border-left: 4px solid #ef4444; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0; font-size: 15px; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; color: #991b1b;">
  <strong>Decision: Rejected</strong>
  <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0; line-height: 1.5;">Unfortunately, your appeal has been rejected and your account remains restricted. Let us know if you have any questions.</p>
</div>
{{#if adminComment}}
<p><strong>Reason from Moderator:</strong></p>
<blockquote style="margin: 10px 0; padding-left: 15px; border-left: 3px solid #e4e4e7; color: #71717a; font-style: italic;">
  {{adminComment}}
</blockquote>
{{/if}}
{{/if}}

<p>Thank you for your cooperation.</p>
<p>Best regards,<br>The RevoShelf Moderation Team</p>
